      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EDITH ACES (3) is a last start placegetter in Grade 5 company, jumping from this box and finishing a 2.75 lengths second over 300m at Q Straight. Has a very honest record from this same draw, including a win and four minors. Looks the one to beat on best. ATOMIC BEAU (2) is a fast beginner who has shown good improvement at his last two starts, rewarded with a win last time at this track over 352m. Has definite claims. BIG BOY ZULU (1) was safely held in tougher company last start after losing his position early at Capalaba, but prior to that won by 2 lengths at Capalaba (20.04) beating Hara's Usain in a P5 on September 2. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Worth following up. UNPAID DEBT (4) is worth including.",
